refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
public Yaf_DispatchernullYaf_Application::getDispatcher
Retrieve the Yaf_Dispatcher instance used by this application.

&reftitle.returnvalues;

 The Yaf_Dispatcher instance, or &null; if the
 application is not properly initialized.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Yaf_Application::getDispatcher example


<?php
$config = array(
    "application" => array(
        "directory" => realpath(dirname(__FILE__)) . "/application",
    ),
);

/** Yaf_Application */
$application = new Yaf_Application($config);
print_r($application->getDispatcher());
?>


